ation scan: Mixture-G2 at 2.0 mm returned 0.854 ns in the coarse scan and 0.866/0.838 ns in repeat fine scans; all tested G1 and G3 configurations were slower, with best sampled G1 1.972 ns and best sampled G3 1.317 ns.\"},{\"requirement\":\"The mixture must be one of the three candidates listed in candidate_specs.md.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"candidate_specs.md lists Mixture-G1, Mixture-G2, and Mixture-G3; the recommendation selects Mixture-G2.\"},{\"requirement\":\"The gas system must comply with the laboratory's environmental and safety policies.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"gas_recirculation.md states that a closed-loop recirculation system with 90% recovery is planned for every mixture; hv_system.md states the HV supplies are compatible with all mixtures. candidate_specs.md states all three mixtures are available in required quantities.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Gas gap between 1 and 3 mm.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Recommended gap is 2.0 mm, which lies within the allowed 1--3 mm range.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Finish by submitting one recommended mixture and gas gap.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"This submission recommends one configuration: Mixture-G2 at 2.0 mm.\"}]}", "call_id": "call_ccwH4J8dk9LFre4uoGxNKwzN", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_000d7330685bffde006afcf2a016f487d0a5cbda06746ed227", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}
